\newlabel{fig:eval-load}{{14}{19}{On-time AI throughput as the load grows, with Poisson arrivals. (a) Measured runs with a 200~ms SLO; the 3.05 requests/s point is the Poisson run of Figure~\ref {fig:eval-burst}, taken on the other node. (b) Replay with the measured service times and a 1,000~ms SLO. Static reservation admits no AI request in this mode}{figure.caption.20}{}}
\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {15}{\ignorespaces One GPU against the paired four-GPU runs. (a) On-time AI tokens per second of the 30 paired natural runs (six arrival patterns at 3 requests/s and four Poisson loads); the diagonal marks equal service. (b) AI prefill time per prompt length over every run, including stopped and padded runs: p99 (bars) and maximum (circles) against the bound of each size (red). (c) Peak GPU memory of the four-GPU placement summed over its GPUs and of the single-GPU placement with one shared recovery receiver; the dashed line marks the memory of one A100.}}{20}{figure.caption.21}\protected@file@percent }
